---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Michael Arnold">
  <header class="site-header">
    <img class="avatar" src="/me.jpg" alt="Michael Arnold" />

    <h1>Michael Arnold</h1>

    <div class="subtitle">Engineer, Creative, Autodidactic</div>

    <div class="socials">
      <a href="https://github.com/michaelarn0ld" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <svg class="github-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path
            d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.3 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385.6.113.82-.258.82-.577 0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61-.546-1.387-1.333-1.757-1.333-1.757-1.089-.744.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.84 1.237 1.84 1.237 1.07 1.835 2.807 1.305 3.492.998.108-.776.418-1.305.762-1.605-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93 0-1.31.468-2.382 1.236-3.222-.123-.303-.535-1.523.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.241 2.873.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.912 1.235 3.222 0 4.61-2.804 5.625-5.475 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222 0 1.606-.015 2.898-.015 3.293 0 .321.216.694.825.576C20.565 21.795 24 17.297 24 12 24 5.37 18.627 0 12 0z"
          ></path>
        </svg>
        GitHub
      </a>
    </div>

    <Nav />
  </header>

  <section id="about">
    <h2>Who I am Professionally</h2>

    <p>
      I'm a software engineer with expertise in distributed systems and platform
      engineering. I currently work at Amazon Ads in San Diego, where I
      build event-driven systems that model and enforce advertising policy, in
      real time, across large-scale global ad serving infrastructure.
    </p>

    <p>
      Previously I worked at AWS on the Aurora MySQL team, where I developed the
      software platform and deployment infrastructure used to validate database
      releases across AWS regions worldwide.
    </p>

    <p>
      My work generally sits at the intersection of scalable backend
      architecture, event-driven systems, and developer infrastructure. I enjoy
      building reliable systems that automate complex operational workflows and
      enable large engineering organizations to move faster and deliver more.
    </p>

    <p>
      I like taking ambiguous and abstract business problems and owning the
      technical solution end to end, from whiteboard to production. I am known
      for deep dives that reach the root of a problem, for design docs and demos
      that make complex systems easy to reason about, and for giving and seeking
      honest feedback early. I care as much about how a system is understood
      and maintained as how it performs.
    </p>

    <p>
      I work as an AI-native engineer. I leverage agentic workflows to
      parallelize my workstreams and automate the busywork. That frees me to push forward
      on several fronts at once and spend my own attention on the judgment calls
      that matter. It lets me move faster and deliver more on behalf of my
      customers.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="projects">
    <h2>Who I am Otherwise</h2>

    <p>
      I'm a surfer, an outdoorsman, a BJJ player, and a friend. When
      life isn't focused on those, I am still building and tinkering on
      projects; this site is one of those projects, where I keep my
      <a href="/blog">writing</a> and <a href="/photos">photography</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Email: <a href="mailto:me@michaelarnold.io">me@michaelarnold.io</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
